# Don't list quartz/static/tools/atlas/ here, even though ATLAS is fetched from
# td10rpg/atlas at build time: Quartz skips gitignored files when it copies
# quartz/static, so the deployed site would have no ATLAS (it broke Oct 24-Nov 9,
# 2026). The local copy is hidden through .git/info/exclude instead, which Quartz
# doesn't read.
